      "excerpt": "Home - Communitech Skip to content Events Programs Membership Pro Squad About Us Our Story Our Team Careers Partner with us Show Site menu Close Site menu Events Programs Membership Pro Squad About Us Our Story Our Team Meet Our Experts Careers Partner with us Join the Community Connect with us We help tech companies start, grow and succeed We are a membership organization shaped by the people building in Waterloo Region. Find Your Place Events Where Waterloo Region's tech community comes together. Nov 17 Coworking Day ​Whether you’re scaling a startup, leading a dev team or looking to plug into Waterloo Region tech ecosystem, the doors to the Communitech Hub are open for you to drop-in and work. 9:00 a.m. – 5:00 p.m. Communitech Hub Founders, Tech Workers, Executives/Leaders, Students, Early Talent, Partners, Investors Register Now Nov 18 The State of Intellectual Property, Cyber and National Security Explore the risks of foreign interference, espionage and IP theft. Hear from former CSIS officer Andrew Kirsch on protecting Canadian technology and what's at stake for national and economic security. 5:00 – 9:00 p.m. Tannery Event Centre Founders, Tech Workers, Executives/Leaders Register Now Nov 26 Tannery Holiday Market Shopping for the holiday season? Join us at the Tannery Event Centre to support local vendors at the Tannery Holiday Market! Skip the malls and support local"
