      "excerpt": "Apply - Communitech Skip to content Events Programs Membership Pro Squad About Us Our Story Our Team Careers Partner with us Show Site menu Close Site menu Events Programs Membership Pro Squad About Us Our Story Our Team Meet Our Experts Careers Partner with us Join the Community Connect with us Communitech helps tech companies start, grow and succeed in Waterloo Region. Founder Membership is available to companies building and selling their own technology products or platforms. Agencies, consultancies and service-based businesses are not eligible. To qualify, your company must: Be headquartered in Ontario, or Have plans to establish a headquarters in Ontario, or Have senior leadership based in Ontario. If you're planning to expand into Ontario or have questions about your eligibility, contact membership@communitech.ca . Founder Members are expected to incorporate their business within 12 months of joining. Incorporation is a requirement for ongoing membership. Questions about this application? Email membership@communitech.ca . First name * Please enter your first name. Last name * Please enter your last name. Email address * Please enter your email address. Company name * Please enter your company name. Company website Please enter company website. Company Address * Please enter a street address. Please enter a city. Please enter a province. Please enter a country. Please"
