      "excerpt": "Apply - Communitech Skip to content Events Programs Membership Pro Squad About Us Our Story Our Team Careers Partner with us Show Site menu Close Site menu Events Programs Membership Pro Squad About Us Our Story Our Team Meet Our Experts Careers Partner with us Join the Community Connect with us Support Canadian Tech Join us in backing Canada’s tech innovators—share your details below and explore how we can build something together. First name * Please enter your first name. Last name * Please enter your last name. Email address * Please enter your email address. Phone number * Please enter your phone number. Company name * Please enter your company name. Company website URL * Please enter a valid URL starting with http:// or https://. Company description * Please enter your response. Employees Worldwide * (Including those in Canada) Please enter number of employees. Which best describes your company’s primary interest in connecting with us? a. We are a startup seeking programming, resources, or connections to grow b. We provide services and/or tools that support startup growth c. We want to grow brand awareness and establish thought leadership among the startup community d. Other (please specify) Please select a response. What are your goals for collaborating with us? * Boost brand visibility and credibility Solve business challenges through startup collaboration Secure"
