      "excerpt": "FAQ - Communitech Skip to content Events Programs Membership Pro Squad About Us Our Story Our Team Careers Partner with us Show Site menu Close Site menu Events Programs Membership Pro Squad About Us Our Story Our Team Meet Our Experts Careers Partner with us Join the Community Connect with us Frequently Asked Questions Communitech What is Communitech? Communitech is a membership network shaped by the people building tech companies in Waterloo Region. Supporting Waterloo Region tech since 1997. Who is Communitech for? Communitech is for founders and teams building and growing tech companies in Waterloo Region. It's also for people working in tech who want to build relationships, keep learning and stay connected to the local tech community. What can Communitech offer for tech workers in Waterloo Region? Communitech offers opportunities to learn, connect and stay involved in Waterloo Region tech. Attend events and workshops, meet people from local tech companies, explore career opportunities and make use of flexible workspace at the Hub. We also share the stories and celebrate the people and companies helping more people discover what's being built in Waterloo Region. Programs & services Does Communitech offer programs for startups and scaling companies? Yes. Communitech offers programs for companies at every stage, from early-stage startups to scaling to established businesses."
